  events:
  - label: 100 M
    sceneName: RooftopRace
    hint: Pick 1 to 16 runners. One 100 m lap of the rooftop track.
    laps: 1
    hurdles: 0
  - label: 400 M
    sceneName: RooftopRace
    hint: Four laps of the roof, 400 m. Bell on the last one.
    laps: 4
    hurdles: 0
  - label: 1500 M
    sceneName: RooftopRace
    hint: Fifteen laps, 1500 m. Around six minutes, and nobody gets up from a fall yet.
    laps: 15
    hurdles: 0
  - label: HURDLES
    sceneName: RooftopRace
    hint: One lap over hurdles that fall over when they are hit. No policy has been trained to jump one, so this is a running race through furniture.
    laps: 1
    hurdles: 1
  - label: LONG JUMP
    sceneName: RooftopLongJump
    hint: Pick 1 to 16 jumpers. Three rounds each on the infield runway; best mark wins.
    laps: 0
    hurdles: 0
  columns: 3
